#. type: TH
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "inotify_init"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:10
msgid "inotify_init, inotify_init1 - initialize an inotify instance"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"B<int inotify_init(void);>\n"
"B<int inotify_init1(int >I<flags>B<);>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:23
msgid "For an overview of the inotify API, see B<inotify>(7)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:27
msgid ""
"B<inotify_init>()  initializes a new inotify instance and returns a file "
"descriptor associated with a new inotify event queue."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:37
msgid ""
"If I<flags> is 0, then B<inotify_init1>()  is the same as "
"B<inotify_init>().  The following values can be bitwise ORed in I<flags> to "
"obtain different behavior:"
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<IN_NONBLOCK>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:47
msgid ""
"Set the B<O_NONBLOCK> file status flag on the open file description (see "
"B<open>(2))  referred to by the new file descriptor.  Using this flag saves "
"extra calls to B<fcntl>(2)  to achieve the same result."
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<IN_CLOEXEC>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:57
msgid ""
"Set the close-on-exec (B<FD_CLOEXEC>)  flag on the new file descriptor.  See "
"the description of the B<O_CLOEXEC> flag in B<open>(2)  for reasons why this "
"may be useful."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:62
msgid ""
"On success, these system calls return a new file descriptor.  On error, -1 "
"is returned, and I<errno> is set to indicate the error."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:68
msgid "(B<inotify_init1>())  An invalid value was specified in I<flags>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:71
msgid "The user limit on the total number of inotify instances has been reached."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:77
msgid "The system-wide limit on the total number of open files has been reached."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:80
msgid "Insufficient kernel memory is available."
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<inotify_init>()"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:87
msgid "Linux 2.6.13, glibc 2.4."
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
#: build/C/man2/inotify_init.2:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<inotify_init1>()"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
